Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:27.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:02:01.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《诺伍德的建筑师》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在刑事专家看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the point of view of the criminal expert, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:03:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦已经变成一座十分乏味\N{\fnArial\fs30}London has become a singularly odd, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有趣的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}interesting city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.43,0:03:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 我不认为会有很多正派的市民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hardly think you'll find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同意你的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}many decent citizens to agree with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 对 我不应该自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well, one must not be selfish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对社会有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}The community's the gain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了可怜的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one the loser say the poor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无事可做以外 谁也没损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}unfortunate specialist whose occupation was got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.19,0:03:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must havebeen totally…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有前总统文件案…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the case of the papers of ex-President…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}荷兰轮船「弗里斯兰」号的惊人事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shocking affair of the Dutch steamship Treesman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后者险些害我们丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}which very nearly cost us both our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们都成功解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of them great successes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 福尔摩斯先生不在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Mr. Holmes is not at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.34,0:03:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我现在见不到他 就会来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I fail to see him now, it will be too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 我帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm sorry, I cannot help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.07,0:03:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但事情真的很紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is a matter of the utmost urgency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.43,0:03:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经说过了 年轻人 福尔摩斯先生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have already told you, young man, Mr. Holmes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.10,0:03:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定得见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I must see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.79,0:04:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟这位年轻人说过你不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told the young man you weren't here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他不听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he wouldn't listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 真对不起 我几乎要疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I'm sorry, but I'm nearly out of my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就是那个倒霉的约翰·赫克托·麦克法兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the unhappy John Hector McFarland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}慢慢告诉我们你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell us quietly and slowly who you are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.15,0:04:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么需要帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what it is that you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你刚才只说了自己的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mentioned your name just now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像我应该认得你似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}as if I should recognize it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我确信\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can assure you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了你是个单身汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}beyond the obvious facts that you are a bachelor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}律师 共济会会员 哮喘病患者这些显见事实外\N{\fnArial\fs30}a solicitor and a freemason and an asthmatic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实对你一点也不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know nothing about you whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你凌乱的衣服 随身带的那一扎法律文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your untidy clothes, sheaf of legal papers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}表链和不规律的喘气声\N{\fnArial\fs30}watch chain and your somewhat irregular breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 福尔摩斯先生 你说的就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, yes, Mr. Holmes, I am all these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除此以外 此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in addition, I am at this moment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:04:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还是全伦敦最不幸的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most unfortunate man in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.85,0:05:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是您看过这份报纸的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've ready our newspaper…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还没看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果您允许的话 麻烦您念一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, if you would allow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨夜凌晨12点左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}At about 12 o'clock last night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下诺伍德发生一起意外事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}an instance occurred at Lower Norwood which points, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐是严重犯罪行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is feared, to a serious crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一住宅背后的小贮木场起火\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small timber yard caught fire at the back of a house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该住宅属于建筑师约纳斯·奥德克所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}belonging to Mr. Jonas Oldacre, a builder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}火灾现场未见户主 令人诧异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise was expressed at Mr. Oldacre's absence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.17,0:05:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然户主已失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it became apparent he had disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}检查卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}An examination of his room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保险柜门已开\N{\fnArial\fs30}revealed a safe which was open, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现场有激烈打斗的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}signs of a murderous struggle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一沉重的手杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a heavy walking stick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.89,0:05:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}柄上沾有血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}with stains of blood upon the handle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.61,0:05:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只求您不要离弃我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ask is that you don't abandon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.67,0:05:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在伦敦桥站刚下车就被跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man has followed me from London Bridge Station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我还没把话讲完以前他们来逮捕我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they arrest me before I finish my story, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}务必请您告诉他们给我时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}make them give me time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把全部事实告诉您\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that I may tell you the whole truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要知道有您在外面为我奔走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could go to jail happy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以高高兴兴地走进监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I knew that you were outside working for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逮捕你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrest you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.31,0:06:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这的确太有意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is really most gratifying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会因什么罪名被逮捕呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what charge do you expect to be arrested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以谋杀下诺伍德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upon the charge of murdering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约纳斯·奥德克的罪名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Jonas Oldacre of Lower Norwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本报付印时\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we go to press, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}案件已出现惊人的发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}sensational development shave been reported.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在火场灰烬中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charred remain shave been found{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.73,0:06:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到被烧焦的残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}among the ashes of the fire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据警方推测\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the police theory is that the victim{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.65,0:06:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受害者被木棍击毙 尸体被焚烧灭迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}was clubbed to death and the body ignited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现已查明奥德克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is known that Mr. Oldacre{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是夜曾接待来客\N{\fnArial\fs30}received a visitor last night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.99,0:06:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该手杖已确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the stick has been identified{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}属于来访者\N{\fnArial\fs30}as belonging to that person, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦一年轻的律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}a young London solicitor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}名为约翰·赫克托·麦克法兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the name of John Hector McFarland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:07:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦克法兰先生 我想问下 你怎么仍逍遥法外呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask why you are still at liberty, Mr. McFarland, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然表面上已经有足够证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}as there seems to be enough evidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以逮捕你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to justify your arrest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.65,0:07:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和母亲同住在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live with my mother, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱克希斯多林顿寓所\N{\fnArial\fs30}at Torrington Lodge in Black heath, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.71,0:07:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but last night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有点事要替奥德克先生办\N{\fnArial\fs30}having late business with Mr. Oldacre, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在诺伍德一家旅馆住下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stayed at a hotel in Norwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我对此事毫不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes, I knew nothing of this affair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到今天早上乘火车回办公室途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I was on the train to my office this morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到报纸上您刚才听过的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and read what you have just heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我立即看出自己的处境非常威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw at once the terrible danger of my position{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就赶来把这件案子委托给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hurried to put the case in your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 雷斯垂德巡官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Inspector Le Strade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都在等着你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have been expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.87,0:08:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·赫克托·麦克法兰先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. John Hector McFarland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于你蓄意谋杀下诺伍德的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I arrest you for the willful murder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约纳斯·奥德克先生 我现在逮捕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Mr. Jonas Oldacreof Lower Norwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 再等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up, just one moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.28,0:08:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再等半个小时左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}A half an hour more or less{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你来说不会有什么影响吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}could make little difference to you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位年轻绅士正要给我们讲述\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this young gentleman was about to give us an account{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这桩非常有趣事件的经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}of this very interesting affair, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.68,0:08:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许能帮助我们把事情弄清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}which might aid usin clearing it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得弄清楚整件事再容易不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no difficulty in clearing it up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 如果你允许的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevertheless, I think with your permission, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我倒很有兴趣听听他的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be much interested in hearing his account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.33,0:08:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很难拒绝你的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no denying that you have been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.59,0:08:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为过去你给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}of use to the force{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮过一两次忙 但我必须…\N{\fnArial\fs30}once or twice in the past, but I must insist…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只请求您一定要听我讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ask is that you should hear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.69,0:08:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且明白我讲的绝对是真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and recognizethe absolute truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我给你半个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give youhalf an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐 麦克法兰先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, McFarland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 雷斯垂德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Le Strade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得先提醒你 你现在所说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must warn you with what you say now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.43,0:09:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都会成为不利于你的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}will appear in evidence against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.77,0:09:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须先说明我对约纳斯·奥德克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must first explain that I knew nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点都不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Mr. Jonas Oldacre, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然他的名字很熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}although his name was familiar to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多年以前 我父母和他认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many years ago, my parents were acquainted with him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但后来逐渐疏远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but… well, they drifted apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 昨天下午大约三点钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so it came as a complete surprise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.13,0:09:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他走进我城里的办公室的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when yesterday afternoon, at about 3 o'clock, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我感到很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}he walked into my office in the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥德克先生 下午好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Oldacre, good afternoon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是麦克法兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Mr. McFarland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是否介意过来一趟呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you care to come through?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.64,0:10:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请先坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, won't you sit down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有什么能为您服务的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我遗嘱的草稿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a draft of my Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望由你 麦克法兰先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you, Mr. McFarland, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按照正式法定的格式把它写出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to cast it into proper legal shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你写的时候 我就在这里坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall sit here while you do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您可以想象出来我的惊讶 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can understand my astonishment, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.40,0:10:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我看到他除了若干保留外\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I found that, with some minor reservations, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.23,0:10:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把其余的全部财产都留给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}his entire estate had been left to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我真的不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I… I simply don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我来简单说明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, let me explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是个单身汉 麦克法兰先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a bachelor, Mr. McFarland, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没多少亲属\N{\fnArial\fs30}with few relatives, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.27,0:11:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人值得我考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and none who deserve my consideration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.05,0:11:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唉 那样说也太…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that may well be so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先听我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me… let me finish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近年来 我已经逐渐不问世事\N{\fnArial\fs30}For many years now, I've with drawn from my business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是建筑师 我敢夸口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a builder, and though I say it myself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在这个领域是出类拔萃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}an extremely successful one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成功地赢得可观的财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Successful enough to have gained considerable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过着离群索居\N{\fnArial\fs30}and thus live out my life in complete, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.61,0:11:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而又舒适的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}if solitary, comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多年前 我遇到你母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many years ago, I knew your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相遇相知 想娶她为妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knew her, and hoped to marry her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后来她嫁给你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she met and married your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我完全不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 你怎么可能知道呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, and why should you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three months ago, why, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read of your father's death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死于布莱克希斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}in The Daily Telegraph, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就想到了你母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my mind was turned to your mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有你这个本可能成为我儿子的年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to the son who might very well have been my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我让你生活无忧的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my way of securing your future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.15,0:12:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我留下的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that whatever I leave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能落在值得信任的人手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be in worthy hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了感谢之外 我真不知道能说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say, but thank you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有些字据 我想该让你过目\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a few documents I think you should see…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}租约 房契\N{\fnArial\fs30}building leases, title deeds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.37,0:12:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抵押凭证等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}mortgages and so on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然我已经拿定主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now my mind's made up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在所有事情办完之后才能放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shan't rest easy until the whole thing's settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 理应如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请在今晚来我家一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you to come to my house tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上9点如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What shall we say, 9 o'clock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欸 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把遗嘱的定稿带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll of course bring the finalized Will, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.59,0:12:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就能把所有的事情都安排妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we can settle the matter once and for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.19,0:12:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, one last thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.80,0:12:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在一切事情还没有办完以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word of this to your dear mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么话都不要和你母亲说\N{\fnArial\fs30}until everything is settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想给她一个小小的意外惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want it to be a little surprised for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小小的 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你答应吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… you promise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向您保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了这次会面我提早出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left in good time for my appointment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那栋房子太难找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but had difficulty in finding the house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我到他家的时候快9点半了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that it was nearly half-past before I reached it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和奥德克先生有约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an appointment with Mr. Oldacre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是麦克法兰先生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. McFarland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那算不上很热情的接待\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not the warmest of receptions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房子有一种怪异的 冷淡的气氛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the house itself had a peculiar, unloved feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉让你久等了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to keep you waiting, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.49,0:13:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别客气 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请恕我来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little late, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把文件都带来了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you brought the papers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 没错 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, indeed. - Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卧室在一楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bedroom was on the ground floor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里有个大的保险柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}where there was a large safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把其余文件都拿过来吧 我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the rest of those papers, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.01,0:14:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在开始工作吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, to business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都办妥了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生 都办妥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, all done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧这时间啊 我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just seen the time, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来的时候还带着一根手杖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a stick with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.43,0:15:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 不知道她放哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I wonder where she put it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一根很厚实的手杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rather heavy walking stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是父亲留给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belonged to my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 不要紧 我会好好保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, never mind, I'll take good care of it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等你下次来取\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we meet again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.64,0:15:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟从现在起 应该能经常见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, I shall be seeing a great deal of you now, I hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.07,0:15:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能经常见面的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed you shall, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我离开了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left him there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保险柜是开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The safe was open, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.78,0:15:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些字据还摆在桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the documents were on his desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经太晚 回不去布莱克希斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was too late to go back to Blackheath, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.93,0:15:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我在诺伍德的旅馆里住了一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so I spent the night at a hotel in Norwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在今天早上以前 我对这起可怕的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew nothing more of this horrible affair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}until this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你手上还有奥德克先生带给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have the original draft of the Will{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.89,0:15:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遗嘱草稿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Oldacre brought to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.62,0:15:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唉 是的 我带过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, yes, I… I have it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.17,0:16:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巡官 能把这些草稿借给我看一天吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I retain this for 24 hours, Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.72,0:16:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假如能对你有所启发的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would amuse you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还有别的要问吗 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anything more you'd like to ask, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我去布莱克希斯前 没什么要问的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until I've been to Blackheath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说去诺伍德以前吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Norwood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 对了 我要说的是诺伍德\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt, that is what I must have meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 麦克法兰先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Mr. McFarland, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的警士就站在门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}my Constable's at the door, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外面还有辆四轮马车在等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a four-wheeler waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早安 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.13,0:16:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这份遗嘱的确有些特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are certain points about this document, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你看呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}are there not Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 我能看出头两行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can read the first two lines{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.57,0:17:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有第二页中间几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}and these in the middle of the second page{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有最后一两行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one or two at the end, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就跟印上去的一样清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they're as clear as print.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但其余部分都写得不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the writing in between is very bad, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.12,0:17:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有几处地方根本看不出写的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's several places where I can't read it at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么解释这一点呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do make of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么解释呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是在火车上写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it was written on the train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}清晰的部分是火车停站的时候写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good writing represents stations, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.80,0:18:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}模糊的部分是火车行驶时写的 最不清晰的部分…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bad writing movement, and the very bad writing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是火车经过岔道时写的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passing over the points?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有经验的专家能马上断定\N{\fnArial\fs30}A scientific expert would pronounce at once{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是在一条郊区铁路线上写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was drawn upon a suburban line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.53,0:18:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since nowhere, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.81,0:18:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有在大城市附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}save in the immediate vicinity of a great city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才会有接二连三的岔道\N{\fnArial\fs30}could there be so quick a succession of points.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.97,0:18:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假如他花了整个旅程的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granting that his whole journey{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来起草这份遗嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}was occupied in drawing up the Will, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.27,0:18:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那必定是一趟快车\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the train must have been an express, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.02,0:18:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在诺伍德和伦敦桥之间只停过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}stopping only once between Norwood and London Bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 但这实在是太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but it's curious, is it not, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.88,0:18:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个人居然会以这么随便的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a man should draw up so important a document{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.53,0:18:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来写一份这么重要的文件？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in so haphazard fashion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这说明他实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it suggests that he thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不重视这份遗嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was going to be of no practical importance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这等于他同时给自己出了一张死刑判决书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he drew up his death warrant at the same time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这件案件对我来说还不是很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}This case is not clear to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, Watson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去哪呢 诺伍德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going, Norwood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 布莱克希斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Blackheath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.69,0:19:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我儿是天底下最敦厚良善的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son's the gentlest creature on God's earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝不相信他会犯下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's inconceivable he could even contemplate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.19,0:19:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此严重的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}such a terrible crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.56,0:19:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他根本不认识这个人 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't even know the man, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:20:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你认识他 麦克法兰夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did, Mrs. McFarland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多年以前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.88,0:20:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我几乎忘记了他的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd forgotten that he ever existed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尝试去忘却\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但要忘记像约纳斯·奥德克这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impossible to quite forget{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.89,0:20:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man like Jonas Oldacre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我很了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I knew him well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.97,0:20:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾经 我们几乎订婚结为夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}At one time, we were engaged to be married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢天谢地我还有眼力离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank heaven I had the sense to turn away from him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟一个也许比他穷 但比他更好的人结了婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and marry a better, if poorer, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.41,0:20:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.45,0:21:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你丈夫最近去世了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband died recently?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是一个宽容 温和的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a kind man, gentle man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.95,0:21:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是和约纳斯·奥德克完全不一样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was everything Jonas Oldacre was not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而 你曾经考虑过嫁给他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, at one time, you were prepared to marry him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说过我熟悉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said that I knew him well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.89,0:21:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我越了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the more I knew of him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.42,0:21:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就越意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more I came to realize{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己根本不清楚他的为人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew him not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.53,0:21:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会突然性情大变 还会恐吓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would change suddenly, would also frighten me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.80,0:21:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他性格里有阴暗的一面 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a dark side to his character, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要制造痛苦的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}A desire to cause pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.33,0:22:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自己的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own photograph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是送给他的第一份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my first present to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.07,0:22:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good heavens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.45,0:22:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我结婚的那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was how it was returned to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.67,0:22:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把照片弄成这样还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}on my wedding day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.69,0:22:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}附着一张卑劣的纸条\N{\fnArial\fs30}together with a vile note{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.44,0:22:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疯狂地诅咒我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}urging a curse upon my house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.95,0:22:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说他永远都不会原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and saying he'd never forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.45,0:22:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 看上去他现在宽恕你了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, he does seem to have forgiven you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟他把自己的全部财产留给了你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}after all, to leave his entire estate to your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.78,0:22:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我儿子和我都不要那个恶人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither my son nor I want anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何东西 不管他是死是活\N{\fnArial\fs30}from that wicked man, dead or alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.27,0:22:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦克法兰夫人 事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. McFarland, the fact remains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.58,0:22:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遗嘱已经拟好\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Will was made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.27,0:22:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只不过不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I simply can't understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.83,0:23:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.09,0:23:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有向儿子谈论过奥德克先生的事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had you ever spoken of Oldacre to your son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许提到过刚才告诉我们的事实？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, perhaps told him what you've just told me now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.98,0:23:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 从未说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.27,0:23:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从来没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.65,0:23:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他看到了照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found the photograph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.23,0:23:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先夫想轻描淡写说一下就算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband tried to make light of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.53,0:23:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他坚持要知道缘由\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he insisted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.24,0:23:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先夫将部分事实真相告诉他 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband told him something of the truth, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.29,0:23:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这孩子听了之后很不安吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the boy was disturbed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.75,0:23:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很自然会心烦意乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was upset, naturally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情况是这样的 麦克法兰夫人 警方可能会认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Mrs. McFarland, what the police might say is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.90,0:23:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他听闻了奥德克先生对你的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he had heard of Oldacre's behavior toward you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.90,0:23:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自然会产生憎恨之心 犯下暴行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would pre-dispose him toward hatred and violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.93,0:24:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该案对他的指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so that case against him would be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.67,0:24:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就有更强而有力的依据了\N{\fnArial\fs30}considerably strengthened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.07,0:24:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.88,0:24:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主在天堂俯视众生 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a God in heaven, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.98,0:24:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主终会惩罚这个邪恶的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that same God who's punished that wicked man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.58,0:24:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只争迟与早\N{\fnArial\fs30}will show in his own good time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.74,0:24:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我儿手上确实没沾染过血污\N{\fnArial\fs30}my son's hands are guiltless of his blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.93,0:24:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请在这儿等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.46,0:24:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 华生先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.60,0:24:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们刚刚清理完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just clearing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.66,0:24:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我之前借阅的遗嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Will as promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.85,0:24:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看 纽扣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, buttons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.29,0:24:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}裤子的纽扣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouser buttons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.34,0:25:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可能 你有带放大镜过来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt, you've brought your glass with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.23,0:25:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上面的名字是海安姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name is Hiams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.16,0:25:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据管家勒克辛顿太太说 海安姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to Mrs. Lexington, the housekeeper, Hiams, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.29,0:25:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是奥德克先生的裁缝的姓氏\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the name of Mr. Oldacre's tailor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.83,0:25:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想必燃烧过后的有机体残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presumably, the organic remains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.86,0:25:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经送去实验室化验了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been removed to the laboratory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.67,0:25:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have, Doctor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.20,0:25:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然未必能派上什么用场\N{\fnArial\fs30}though they'll be of little use, I suspect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.78,0:25:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个倒霉的家伙早已烧成灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poor devil was no more than bone and cinder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.42,0:25:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对凶手来说多么方便啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How very convenient for the murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.10,0:25:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然对奥德克先生来说可不怎么方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not I might venture for Mr. Oldacre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.71,0:25:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然如此 巡官 好歹是骨头渣子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevertheless, Inspector, bones cinder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.29,0:25:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢天谢地 幸好他还穿着裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank heavens, he was wearing his trousers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.89,0:25:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那根手杖的确是属于被告的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stick belongs to the accused, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.87,0:25:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也承认了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's never denied it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.00,0:25:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他声称离开房子的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says that he could not find it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找不到那根手杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he came to leave the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.23,0:25:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一面之词 福尔摩斯先生 一面之词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says, Mr. Holmes, says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的技术人员在地毯上\N{\fnArial\fs30}My experts made out footmarks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.14,0:25:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到两组脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}of both men on the carpet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.87,0:26:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后有无数人踏足此处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And too much subsequent traffic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.64,0:26:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我基本上查不出什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make any examination on my part worthwhile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.53,0:26:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有两组脚印 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two sets of footmarks, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.21,0:26:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有第三者的脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of any third person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.50,0:26:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你们布的又一个疑阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another trick for your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.56,0:26:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}依我看 这些字据都是从保险柜里拿出来的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose all these papers are from the safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.28,0:26:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.70,0:26:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 没有任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing, absolutely nothing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.44,0:26:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被移动过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been removed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.69,0:26:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing whatsoever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.19,0:26:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如你所见 有一两封已经拆开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have opened one or two, as you can see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.07,0:26:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来检查里面的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}to check the contents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.91,0:26:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以看看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I check them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.86,0:26:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}By all means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.36,0:26:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还得回苏格兰场办点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, myself, have business at The Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.46,0:26:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了 我想见一下女管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and I would like to see the housekeeper…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.82,0:26:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is her name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.97,0:26:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}勒克辛顿太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Lexington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.61,0:26:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也提供不了什么新情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll add nothing more to what you already know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.32,0:26:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是让我见见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevertheless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.11,0:26:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我让她进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send her in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.01,0:26:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道这会成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could it be that for once{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.58,0:27:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德有史以来第一次胜利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Le Strade is on the right track?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.87,0:27:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的所有直觉都指向一个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my instincts are one way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.43,0:27:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情另有隐衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the facts are the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 你要见我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish to see me, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.17,0:27:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 勒克辛顿太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mrs. Lexington{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.78,0:27:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位是我的挚友及同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is my friend and colleague, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.34,0:27:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.87,0:27:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.86,0:27:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果可以的话 请容许我站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stand, if I may.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.16,0:27:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这房间让我觉得不太舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}This room has no comfort for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.44,0:27:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你让麦克法兰先生进来的时候是9点半吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let young Mr. McFarland into this house at 9:30?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.93,0:27:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时我该好好考虑一下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that my hand had withered before I'd done so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.20,0:27:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在什么时候上床休息的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you retired to bed at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.64,0:27:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十一点二十分\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 minutes past 11:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.93,0:27:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十一点二十分\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 minutes past 11:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.46,0:27:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么都没听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you heard nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.42,0:27:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的房间在房子另一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}My room is at the far end of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.99,0:28:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在火警响起前什么都没听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard nothing until the fire alarm sounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.78,0:28:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在那个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was then, only then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.91,0:28:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我意识到不幸的主人已经被谋害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I realized my poor master had been murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.62,0:28:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}勒克辛顿太太 据你所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Lexington, to your knowledge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.71,0:28:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的主人有仇人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}did your master have any enemies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.58,0:28:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁没有仇人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every man has his enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.22,0:28:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像奥德克先生这样的生意人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a businessman like Mr. Oldacre, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.14,0:28:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许仇家就更多了 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than most, perhaps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.57,0:28:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是一位受人尊敬的绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a well-respected gentleman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.27,0:28:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直独来独往\N{\fnArial\fs30}who kept himself very much to himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.94,0:28:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对这些字据是否知情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know anything about these papers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.13,0:28:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对奥德克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.18,0:28:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的私人事务一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Mr. Oldacre'sprivate affairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.92,0:28:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警方在灰烬里发现的纽扣呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The buttons that the police found in the fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.66,0:28:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主人有三套衣服是由海安姆先生缝制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My master had three suits made by Mr. Hiams…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.59,0:28:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两套在衣橱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}two are still in that wardrobe there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.50,0:28:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第三套当天晚上他穿在身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the third he was wearing that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.59,0:28:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 勒克辛顿太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mrs. Lexington, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.33,0:28:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你非常很合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have been most cooperative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.01,0:28:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得她怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.39,0:29:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}守口如瓶 依我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tight as wax, if you ask me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.00,0:29:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但也许 这只是她一贯的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then, perhaps that's her usual manner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.80,0:29:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道一切都不对 我从骨子里感受到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all wrong, I feel it in my bones, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.32,0:29:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有些重要情况是我们一无所知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}something… something has not come out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.16,0:29:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而女管家是知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that woman knows it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.84,0:29:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 能让我看看这些字据吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, would you like me to have a look at these papers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.55,0:29:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个人的银行账号所透露的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a man's bank account can tell us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.42,0:29:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就和日记所泄露的一样多\N{\fnArial\fs30}as much as his diary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.83,0:29:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.06,0:29:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.68,0:29:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right Constable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.18,0:29:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是舒展一下腿脚而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just stretching my legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.20,0:29:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会看着他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Constable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.30,0:31:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是本地人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a local man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.79,0:31:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在伦敦桥出生 先生 离这儿半公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born on Bridge, sir, not a half-mile from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.83,0:31:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.04,0:31:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能给我提供一点当地的消息吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then perhaps you can offer me some local knowledge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.40,0:31:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会尽力而为的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.29,0:32:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定尽我所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll most certainly do my best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.15,0:32:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.65,0:32:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德确实说过字据都没有被动过吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Le Strade did say that no documents had been removed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.20,0:32:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.55,0:32:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也觉得他没动过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.77,0:32:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有什么发现吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've found something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.02,0:32:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 一无所获才令我觉得很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's what I haven't found that interests me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.11,0:32:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比对过后发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are certain cross-references{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.92,0:32:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实发生过几笔交易 金额颇大的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}to various deeds, valuable deeds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.35,0:32:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但找不到凭证\N{\fnArial\fs30}none of which I can find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.79,0:32:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有一事相当明确\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one thing is clear:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.60,0:32:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有理由相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oldacre was hardly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.88,0:32:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥德克先生的境况\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the affluent circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.66,0:32:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不是太富裕\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have been led to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.26,0:32:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的银行帐户余额所剩无几\N{\fnArial\fs30}His bank account was practically empty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.03,0:32:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主要是因为过去一年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}largely because he had made several large payments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.22,0:32:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他开了几张大额支票给柯尼利亚斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the past year to a certain Mr. Cornelius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.41,0:33:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦克法兰先生实际上一无所得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young McFarland would have inherited nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.34,0:33:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事大有蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is of interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.97,0:33:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么一个退隐的建筑师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should a retired builder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.27,0:33:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会和这位柯尼利亚斯先生有这样的大宗交易呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}have such large transactions with a Mr. Cornelius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.29,0:33:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗳 我们坐车回城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's take our cab, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.48,0:33:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看能不能从他的银行账号里找到什么线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see what we can find out from his city bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.23,0:33:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.07,0:33:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想再多留一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay here for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.69,0:33:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诺伍德火车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norwood Station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.40,0:33:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 你不打算和朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're not going back to London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.45,0:33:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起回伦敦了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your friend, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.26,0:33:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 暂时先不回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not yet, anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.14,0:33:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望我的存在不会给你造成不便\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do hope my presence doesn't inconvenience you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.99,0:33:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便提一下 我应当警告你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I should warn you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.15,0:33:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现有形迹可疑的人在大门窥视\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found an undesirable lurking about by the gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.66,0:33:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.67,0:33:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}形迹可疑的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}An undesirable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.89,0:33:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个流浪汉 勒克辛顿太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tramp, Mrs. Lexington, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.49,0:33:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}流落街头的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a gentlemen of the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.68,0:33:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我什么都给不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will get nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.83,0:33:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 你不认为应该对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you don't believe in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.41,0:33:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比我们不幸的人伸出援手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}supporting our less fortunate brethren?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.22,0:34:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能养活自己 他们也理应如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work, so can they.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.39,0:34:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.53,0:35:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在去克莱克斯顿的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way to Croxton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.38,0:35:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经流浪够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done enough walking, I have…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.92,0:35:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走遍各个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}To all kinds of places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.46,0:35:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就留在这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay put.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.31,0:35:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾在这里和朋友会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to meet a friend of mine here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.74,0:35:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 你可能会认识他 他是个海员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you might know him, he's a seafaring man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.20,0:35:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿哈 我知道有这么个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah-ha I know him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.52,0:35:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我一起睡了四晚的人 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shared my billet for the last four nights, he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.39,0:35:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后他就一言不发地离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And off he goes, without even a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.98,0:35:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take my tip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.43,0:35:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和他撇清关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay clear of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.79,0:35:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.03,0:35:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可没有这样对待过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't strike me as such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.58,0:35:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他去过那个大房子里 他去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He goes up to that big house, he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.60,0:35:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他回来之后就瞎扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He comes back here and tells some yarn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.88,0:36:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说和那里的老先生聊得很欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}about him putting out with old mans, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.71,0:36:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位先生让他第二天再过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and telling him to come back tomorrow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.63,0:36:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说是会给他一点食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they'll give him some grub{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.33,0:36:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有几件旧衣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some cast-offs for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.94,0:36:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 这怎么算是撒谎呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how is that lying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.08,0:36:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, my friend, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.66,0:36:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也曾经去过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already paid my call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.27,0:36:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结果几乎被打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I nearly got my lord on my back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.29,0:36:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说我厚颜无耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}for my insolence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.10,0:36:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无礼之极\N{\fnArial\fs30}insolence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.01,0:36:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他说的故事更讨人喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps he told you a pleasing tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.79,0:36:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.26,0:36:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个醉酒的船员比我这个22军团的军士\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a drunken sailor has more to offer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.94,0:36:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有办法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}than a Sergeant in the 22nd?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.87,0:36:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.68,0:36:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.85,0:37:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说 「无论我得到什么」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says, Whatever I get, he says, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.47,0:37:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我都会和你一起分享的 伙计」 他是这样说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll share with you, shipmate, he says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.64,0:37:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后他就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off he goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.88,0:37:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从此不见踪影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a sight of him since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.92,0:38:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.21,0:38:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得先吃点东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must permit yourself some food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.21,0:38:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定得吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.91,0:38:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在匀不出精力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A present, I cannot afford energy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.87,0:38:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来消化食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nerve force for digestion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.86,0:38:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗳 如果你还想继续调查这件案子就得吃啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you must if you intend to pursue this case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.42,0:38:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我感觉 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel, my dear fellow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.30,0:39:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这件案子将不光彩地以雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}that our case will end ingloriously{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.14,0:39:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吊死咱们的委托人来结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Le Strade hanging our client, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.89,0:39:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对苏格兰场无疑会成为一次胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}which will certainly be atriumph for Scotland Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.93,0:39:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来了一份电报\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a telegram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.32,0:39:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新获重要证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Important fresh evidence at hand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.65,0:39:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦克法兰罪行已定\N{\fnArial\fs30}McFarland's guilt definitely established, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.12,0:39:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奉劝放弃此案 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}advise you to abandoncase, Le Strade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.84,0:39:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是雷斯垂德自鸣得意的小胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Le Strade's little cockle-doodle of victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.27,0:40:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们先吃早饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have some breakfast, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.05,0:40:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后一块出去看看有什么可做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then go out together and see what we can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.07,0:40:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天我觉得需要你的陪伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel as if I shall need your company{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.36,0:40:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和精神援助\N{\fnArial\fs30}and moral support today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.01,0:40:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 福尔摩斯先生 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Mr. Holmes, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.67,0:40:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这次你们得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you will acknowledge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.44,0:40:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们走在你前头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we're just a little in front of you this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.26,0:40:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请到这边来 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step this way, if you please, gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.94,0:40:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我能彻底说服你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm sure I can convince you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.41,0:41:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·麦克法兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was John McFarland{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.56,0:41:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是本案的真凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}who committed this crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.34,0:41:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都讨厌自己是错的那一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like being wrong anymore than the rest of us do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.99,0:41:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 一个人总不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, a man can't always{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.76,0:41:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}指望事事如意\N{\fnArial\fs30}expect to have it his own way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.27,0:41:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是这样 华生医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}can he Dr. Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.35,0:41:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是女管家放置\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where the housekeeper left{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.36,0:41:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦克马兰先生手杖的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}McFarland's hatand stick, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.96,0:41:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是他作案之后必定过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is also where he would have come{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.91,0:41:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿回自己帽子的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}to collect his hat after the crime was committed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.83,0:41:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.69,0:41:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个大拇指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thumb mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.02,0:41:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如我观察到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I observe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.37,0:41:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带血的大拇指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thumb mark in blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.67,0:41:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道大拇指的指纹没有两个同样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are aware that no two thumb marks are alike?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.49,0:41:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说过类似这样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard something of the kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.26,0:42:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.07,0:42:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是今天早上从麦克法兰手上取来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was taken from McFarland this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.32,0:42:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对是同一个大拇指印出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely the same thumb mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.44,0:42:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是决定性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is final.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.60,0:42:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是决定性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite final.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.64,0:42:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁作出这个惊人的发现的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who made this discovery?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.93,0:42:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是女管家勒克辛顿太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Mrs. Lexington here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.95,0:42:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我的警士的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who drew my Constable's attention to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.95,0:42:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I suppose, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.27,0:42:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可能这血迹昨天就在墙上吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no doubt that the mark was there yesterday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.85,0:42:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗳 当然麦克法兰会深夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, of course McFarland could have crept out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.97,0:42:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从监狱里跑出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}of jail in the middle of the night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.98,0:42:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}增加对自己不利的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to strengthen the evidence against himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.45,0:42:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.12,0:42:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会反对我到楼上转转吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you any objection if I take a stroll upstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.81,0:42:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, none at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.83,0:42:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是上面什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing up there, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.81,0:44:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情况看起来很不利 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many things look so bad, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.47,0:44:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这个证据中有一个十分严重的缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is a serious flaw in this new evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.43,0:44:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么缺陷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.86,0:44:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天我检查门厅的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thumb print was not there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.77,0:44:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}墙上并没有血指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I examined the hall yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.11,0:44:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector Le Strade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.89,0:44:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得你的证据不充足\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot help thinking your evidence is incomplete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.85,0:44:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是什么意思呢 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.91,0:44:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是要说有一个重要的证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merely that there is an important witness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.75,0:44:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还没有见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have not yet seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.60,0:44:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能引见一下这位证人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can produce this witness, can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.93,0:44:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.68,0:44:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 请让他出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, do so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.13,0:44:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.08,0:44:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有几个警士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many Constables have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.04,0:44:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能马上召集来的有三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three within call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.74,0:44:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.23,0:44:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都是体型健壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume that they are able-bodied, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.81,0:45:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}声音洪亮的大个子吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}large men with powerful voices?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.14,0:45:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt that they are, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.87,0:45:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外面的小屋里有一大堆麦秸\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the outhouse, there is a quantity of straw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.10,0:45:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你们搬两捆进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like two bundles brought in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.36,0:45:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦秸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.34,0:45:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再提两桶水\N{\fnArial\fs30}And two buckets of water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.74,0:45:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}水？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.93,0:45:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把东西都带到顶层平台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask them to bring it to the top landing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.45,0:45:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦秸放进壁炉 往前一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straw, into the fireplace, a little bit in front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.69,0:45:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两桶水放到那边 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two buckets of water to that side, Constable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.30,0:45:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.50,0:45:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你是不是在跟我们开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know whether you'replaying a game with us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.24,0:45:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以照直跟我们说 不用故弄玄虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but surely tell us without all this tom-foolery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.24,0:45:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你保证 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you, Le Strade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.83,0:45:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我做每件事都有完全理由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an excellent reason for everything that I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.80,0:45:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你点着麦秸好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, would you put a match to that straw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.88,0:45:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警官 到时麻烦你用水把火扑灭好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Constable, will you sprinkle it with water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.25,0:46:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 我们来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we must see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.18,0:46:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能不能给你找出那个证人来 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we can find this witness for you, Le Strade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.22,0:46:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.67,0:46:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们跟我一起大喊着火 好吗 ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you please join meand we'll call a fire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.41,0:46:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一 二 三 「着火啦」\N{\fnArial\fs30}one, two three… Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.53,0:46:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「着火啦」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.61,0:46:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还能喊得更大声一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do better than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.73,0:46:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起敞开嗓门大喊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full voice, and together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.34,0:46:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「着火啦」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.58,0:47:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good heavens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.79,0:47:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警官 拿一桶水洒在麦秸上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Constable, a bucket of water on that straw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.53,0:47:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德 请允许我向你介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Le Strade, allow me to present you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.62,0:47:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是本案失踪的重要证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your missing principal witness,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.65,0:47:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约纳斯·奥德克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Jonas Oldacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.48,0:47:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.40,0:47:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这些时候在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you been doing all this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.26,0:47:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done no harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.10,0:47:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没害人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}NO harm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.67,0:47:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想尽一切办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've only done your best{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.20,0:47:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要把一个无辜的人送上绞架\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get an innocent man hanged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.28,0:47:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不是有这位先生的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasn't for this gentleman standing here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.72,0:47:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说不定你就得逞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure you wouldn't have succeeded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.36,0:47:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他带下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.17,0:47:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让咱们看看这只耗子之前躲在什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see where this rat has been lurking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.65,0:47:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是做建筑师的有利条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you see the advantage of being a builder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.97,0:47:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能给自己打造一个隐秘的藏身之所\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was able to fix up his own little hiding place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.51,0:47:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不需要任何人帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}without any confederate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.35,0:47:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然他那个女管家除外\N{\fnArial\fs30}save for that precious housekeeper of his, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.54,0:47:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该马上把她也放进你的猎囊 巡官\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom I should lose no time in adding to your bag, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.68,0:47:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些就是遗失的字据吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these are the missing papers, no doubt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.70,0:48:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt what so ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.86,0:48:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警官 把女管家找来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Constable, find the housekeeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.29,0:48:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是怎么想到这个地方的 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know about that place, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.97,0:48:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我对比这个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I compared the proportions of this room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.23,0:48:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和楼下房间的比例时\N{\fnArial\fs30}with those of the room below, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.28,0:48:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我推测壁炉的墙是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deduced that this fireplace wall was false.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.76,0:48:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥德克虽然胆量过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oldacre clearly had a great deal of nerve, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.96,0:48:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但却没有足够勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}but little enough, I've found, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.98,0:48:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能在火警面前呆着不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}to like quiet before an alarm of fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.51,0:48:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你究竟是怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in the world did you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.66,0:48:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他藏在屋里的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he was in the house at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.91,0:48:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那枚拇指印 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thumb mark, Le Strade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.34,0:48:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我昨天检查大厅的时候 墙上确实什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I examined the hall yesterday, it was clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.32,0:48:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 指印是后来在夜里按上去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, it must have been put there during the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.27,0:48:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么按上去的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.56,0:48:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当晚麦克法兰检查字据后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After McFarland had examined the papers that night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.22,0:48:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}封存字据\N{\fnArial\fs30}he resealed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.78,0:48:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样就在封蜡上留下了姆指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do so, he used his thumb upon the wax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.46,0:48:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在密室盘算一切的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brooding in that den of his, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.10,0:48:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥德克灵机一动\N{\fnArial\fs30}it suddenly struck Oldacre{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.36,0:48:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想到可以好好利用那枚指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}what use he could make of that thumbprint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.01,0:48:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在蜡模上抹上血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smearing the wax with a little blood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.76,0:48:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以此制造出足以证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}he made what appeared to be absolutely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.05,0:49:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦克法兰有罪的确证\N{\fnArial\fs30}damning evidence against McFarland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.75,0:49:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他制造这个大骗局的苦心是什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what was the object of his deception?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.39,0:49:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看 是这么回事 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well, you see Inspector, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.10,0:49:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了骗过那些紧追不放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to swindle his creditors, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.97,0:49:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有债主\N{\fnArial\fs30}who were pressing him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.89,0:49:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥德克通过给某柯尼利亚斯先生开出大额\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oldacre emptied his bank account by paying out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.39,0:49:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}支票的方式 清空了自己的银行帐户\N{\fnArial\fs30}several large sums to acertain Mr. Cornelius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.28,0:49:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我可以认定奥德克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I have no doubt that Messers Oldacre{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.23,0:49:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和柯尼利亚斯先生是同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Cornelius are one and the same person, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.38,0:49:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}改名换姓的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the object being to change his name, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.13,0:49:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是取出所有款项 然后销声匿迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}draw on the money, and then vanish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.88,0:49:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们所面对的 是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We see before us a very deep, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.70,0:49:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常恶毒 报复心强的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}malicious and vindictive man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.38,0:49:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是否知道麦克法兰的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that he was once refused{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.15,0:49:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从前拒绝过他的求婚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}by McFarland's mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.65,0:49:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他终其一生都渴望报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}All his life, he has longed for vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.78,0:49:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假如能让人误认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he could give the impression{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.66,0:49:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是被旧情人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he was murdered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.95,0:49:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}独子谋杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the only child of his former sweetheart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.14,0:49:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有比这更好的报复方式吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what more better revenge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.54,0:49:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝对不会允许有任何实质性伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never have allowed any real harm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.94,0:49:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生在麦克法兰先生身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to befall poor Mr. McFarland, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.58,0:49:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.58,0:49:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那要留待陪审团来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for the jury to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.53,0:49:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要控告我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're charging me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.83,0:49:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了一个恶作剧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a joke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.18,0:49:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只不过是一个恶作剧而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing more than a practical joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.96,0:50:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是 谋杀啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing less than murder…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.91,0:50:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}记得火灾里的尸体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the body in the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.48,0:50:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是谁的尸体？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whose body was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.21,0:50:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个老海员 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}And old sailor, Le Strade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.16,0:50:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个时运不济的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who had fallen upon hard times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.49,0:50:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在检查火灾留下来的灰烬时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I examined the ashes of that fire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.58,0:50:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现你的专家们漏掉了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I discovered that your experts had missed this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.88,0:50:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一只尖利的白色牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a tooth of the great white shark, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.89,0:50:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能看到它上面有轻微雕琢过的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you see that it has been lightly carved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.33,0:50:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然是海员的随身装饰物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is typical of the work carried out by seamen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.74,0:50:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这并不足以证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this isn't evidence enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.77,0:50:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在火灾里丧命的就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}to show who died in the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.74,0:50:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很确定周一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know for certain that on Monday, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.86,0:50:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谋杀案发生的前一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}the day before the murder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.40,0:50:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个流浪汉来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}a tramp called at this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.93,0:50:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而 我盘问女管家的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet, when I questioned the housekeeper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.20,0:50:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她向我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}she assured me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.21,0:50:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里绝不可能欢迎流浪汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}that no such tramp would ever be welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.93,0:50:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但实际上不但好好接待了那个流浪汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only was his reception welcoming, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.09,0:51:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还把奥德克先生的几件旧衣服给他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the man received some of Oldacre's clothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.05,0:51:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天在前门附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, near the front gate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.32,0:51:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现了他留下了的记号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found the calling card that he left, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.24,0:51:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用暗号通知流浪的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}a coded sign advising his fellow travelers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.23,0:51:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有慷慨的施舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a charitable welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.99,0:51:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And last night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.64,0:51:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你手下的本地警士帮助下\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the help of your local Constable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.20,0:51:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和其中一个流浪者谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to one of these fellow travelers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.48,0:51:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说那个不幸的海员\N{\fnArial\fs30}who said that the unfortunate seaman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.54,0:51:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二天又被请回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}had been asked to call back the following day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.21,0:51:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说会有更殷勤的款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the assurance of further hospitality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.14,0:51:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 之后那天早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, the next morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.21,0:51:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他穿着新衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}wearing his new clothes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.88,0:51:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少是穿着新裤子 折返那里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}or at least his new trousers, he returned…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.65,0:51:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从此再也没有人见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was never seen again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.40,0:51:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你拯救了一个无辜人的性命 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've saved an innocent man's life, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.05,0:51:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还挽救了我 给我免去了一场丑闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've also saved me some embarrassment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.84,0:51:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 我的好兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, my good chap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.87,0:51:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会发现自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find that your reputation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.54,0:51:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此案后名声大振\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been enormously enhanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.58,0:51:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要把你写的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make a few alterations to that report{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.63,0:51:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍加改动\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you are writing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.16,0:52:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们就会觉得想要蒙骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they will understand how hard it is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.04,0:52:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德巡官的眼睛有多么难啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}to throw dust in the eyes of Inspector Le Strade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.33,0:52:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不希望报告中有你的名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want your name to appear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.91,0:52:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点也不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.30,0:52:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}工作本身就是奖赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}His work is its own reward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.69,0:52:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会等着看你上绞架的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you hang for this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.10,0:52:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这话该是我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That privilege must surely be mine.{\r}
